Package: quartoReactive
Title: Reactive Data-Driven Interactivity for Quarto HTML Documents
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pieter", "Seinen", email = "p.seinen@ggdhvb.nl",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a pipe-friendly, visual-agnostic framework for adding
    client-side interactivity to standalone Quarto HTML documents. Declare
    filters on a data.frame with filter_on(), place input controls with
    render_inputs(), and connect any supported htmlwidget (plotly, DT,
    leaflet) via a universal reactive() wrapper. No server required —
    everything runs in the browser.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
